OL,3,AIsrael opens up bids for
OL,4,Ahighly-sensitive West Bank settlement
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband has
OL,8,Fcondemned the publication of a tender
OL,9,Fas "an unacceptable and destructive
OL,10,Fact", and called on Israel to "halt E1
OL,11,Fplans immediately, retract the tender
OL,12,Fand stop all settlement expansion".
